----------------------------------------+-------------+----------------------+------------------
 _timescaledb_internal._hyper_1_1_chunk | time        |     1704067200000000 | 1704153600000000
 _timescaledb_internal._hyper_1_1_chunk | device      | -9223372036854775808 |       1431655764

